"""Creature Workbench for Maya -- complete single-file edition, v1.1.0.

AI-assisted implementation developed with OpenAI Codex.
Requires Autodesk Maya with Python 3; not a standalone desktop application.

USAGE
  Drag this .py file into Maya's viewport, or execute it in Script Editor's
  Python tab. The whole implementation is below; no sibling modules required.

SCOPE AND VERIFICATION
  Guided help, native retopology, original procedural head topology, landmark
  fitting, basic creature rigs, skin transfer, UV workflows and diagnostics.
  The original head is a construction template, not a production facial rig.
  30 host-independent tests passed for the modular source. Maya runtime/UI
  and paid-plugin integration have NOT been tested in the build environment.
  Human fitting requires centimeter working units. Inspect deformation before
  describing any generated mesh as animation-ready.

PROVENANCE
  No third-party mesh, learned weights or vendor algorithm is bundled.
  The procedural head and fitting implementation were authored for this tool.
  Optional paid tools must be installed/licensed separately.

Readable sections retain the original comments. Repeated standard imports are
intentional. The final entry points launch the GUI without external tool files.
"""


